      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1134. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $\\left(\\frac{1}{14}-\\frac{2}{7}\\right):(-3)-6\\frac{1}{13}:\\left(-6\\frac{1}{13}\\right)$；",
        "2) $\\left(7-8\\frac{4}{5}\\right)\\cdot2\\frac{7}{9}-15:\\left(\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "60. 圆的面积"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图166画有一个圆和两个正",
        "方形$ABCD$与$EFKM$. 圆半径等",
        "于$r$，所以正方形$ABCD$的边长",
        "为$2r$，它的面积等于$4r^2$. 三角形",
        "$EOF$的面积为正方形$AEOF$的",
        "面积的$\\frac{1}{2}$，所以正方形$EFKM$",
        "的面积为正方形$ABCD$的面积的",
        "$\\frac{1}{2}$，即等于$2r^2$. 圆面积$S$大于正"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 166",
      "box": [
        869,
        1047,
        496,
        498
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-166"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 166",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方形$EFKM$的面积，但小于正方形$ABCD$的面积：",
        "$2r^2<S<4r^2$.",
        "圆的面积约等于$3r^2$. 比较精确的计算表明，系数3应改成$\\pi$",
        "的值：$\\pi=3.14\\ldots$. 从而有，",
        "$S=\\pi r^2$."
      ]
    },
